cff-version: 1.2.0
title: RASopathy evidence audits
message: >-
  If you refer to this work, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rodrigues
    given-names: Fernando
    alias: Fernandosr85
abstract: >-
  Two audits of a RASopathy gene panel examining separate points at which a
  measurement fails to become clinical evidence: whether a clinical variant is
  matched to the correct functional experiment (PS3/BS3 ascertainment), and
  whether reference data support the computational evidence strength being
  assigned (PP3/BP4 calibration).
keywords:
  - RASopathies
  - ACMG
  - variant classification
  - MaveDB
  - ClinGen
  - variant effect prediction
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Fernandosr85/rasopathy-evidence-audits'
